-- Conformance 0019 (dialect: software, v0.2 surface combinators — ADR-0038)
-- Surface `fold` (ADR-0037): reversible mapAccumL. The body is the prelude's
-- cnot with the list ELEMENT as control, so threading the accumulator
-- head-to-tail computes parity: acc_out = acc_in xor (number of I elements),
-- while the spine is preserved unchanged. At D = 4 (ADR-0035) BitList lowers
-- to the 4-layer spine holding lists of length <= 3 (15 inhabitants).
type BitList = Nil | Cons (Bit * BitList)

iso parity : BitList * Bit <-> BitList * Bit = fold BitList cnot
